(Elyano Connect is packaged as an optimized, production-hardened binary and pre-compiled asset release. The client-side) Tj
T* (React UI is minified and bundled into static HTML/JS/CSS, and the server-side logic is bundled into a single CommonJS) Tj
T* (executable \(dist/server.cjs\). Healthcare organizations can deploy, host, and run the entire hospital platform on their internal) Tj
T* (infrastructure without needing or exposing any TypeScript or React source code.) Tj
